Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End Morning, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready to start the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, whoops, I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't hurt you, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, but do try to be a bit more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, Lene, you should know -
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since we lost Lene,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Miss Claire's still having\Na really hard time moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.02,0:00:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish there was something I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.34,0:00:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.26,0:00:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about I whip up something\Nsugary and delicious for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.44,0:00:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did this idea come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe fondant au chocolat?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.88,0:00:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or a decadent creme brulee?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.06,0:00:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heck, why pick one when we\Ncan have a little of both?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.50,0:00:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A creme brulee?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.36,0:01:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.68,0:01:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it takes to cheer\Nyou up and make you smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.30,0:01:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am perfectly cheery, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.06,0:01:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then how about a big hug? A hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm, alright thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're beautiful and I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.24,0:01:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and for the thousandth\Ntime, I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.92,0:01:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, you're as incorrigible\Nas ever, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.16,0:01:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now stop chit-chatting\Nand get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.32,0:01:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and before I forget, a\Nletter came for you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.10,0:01:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A letter from whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.80,0:01:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's from a Miss Manaria Sousse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.98,0:01:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sister wrote to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.74,0:01:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dearest Claire, I hope this\Nletter finds you in good health.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.06,0:01:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for the short notice,\Nand any surprise this may bring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:02:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that my heart, unwavering.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.16,0:02:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remains by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.06,0:02:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all my love.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.43,0:02:04.94,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fn.Savoye LET CC.\fs140\b0\blur0.6\c&HFFFDFE&\pos(1650,-20)}"{\fn00426\fs55\b0\blur0.6\pos(1630,30)\c&HFFFDFE&}With love, your Manaria{\fn.Savoye LET CC.\fs140\b0\blur0.6\c&HFFFDFE&}"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.78,0:02:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.46,0:02:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's coming?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.57,0:02:16.86,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Must you tell me every thought that crosses your mind?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.16,0:02:19.83,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I've gotta tell you how I feel!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.99,0:02:22.79,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Are you so unaware of how different our worlds are?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.08,0:02:25.97,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Then let's bring up a revolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.46,0:02:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.97,0:02:28.93,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Do you know? Who I am
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.86,0:02:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hold
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.93,0:02:31.96,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Yes, I know! That sky-high pride of yours
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.96,0:02:34.98,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}What you want? Tell me now!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.98,0:02:37.30,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}All I want! Only you!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.30,0:02:41.19,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}No matter how immersive this game may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.19,0:02:43.68,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Aren't you way too into it?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.68,0:02:45.31,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}If I do it differently,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.31,0:02:47.15,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}there won't be a happy ending
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.15,0:02:49.56,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}What nonsense are you babbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.75,0:02:53.07,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}My wildest fantasies became my reality…
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.07,0:02:55.57,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Ah, cool! You're cool! Beautiful!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.76,0:02:58.82,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Bringing such disruption to my once peaceful days…
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.16,0:03:01.58,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I can't believe! You have to leave!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.79,0:03:03.45,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Love and hate both,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.45,0:03:09.69,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Without a partner, those feelings can never start!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.33,0:03:12.30,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}So raise your hands!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.30,0:03:16.09,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}It's time to give in to happiness!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.09,0:03:21.05,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}There's only one right choice here:
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.05,0:03:22.93,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}from the bottom of your heart, hold up and
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.93,0:03:25.68,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Raise your hands! Surrender already!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.68,0:03:28.98,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! Throw 'em up and celebrate!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.98,0:03:31.77,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! One more time!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.77,0:03:34.40,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! For this fantastic world!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.40,0:03:38.28,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I won't give up until you tell me what you're planning!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.28,0:03:41.12,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}You're so awesome! I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.90,0:03:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.99,0:03:48.00,Signs_EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\shad0\blur1\pos(0,0)\c&HFFFFFD&\fscx100\fscy100\p1}m 122 764 l 123 309 524 127 936 124 947 134 965 137 979 133 986 123 1458 126 1802 373 1802.29 766.86 1462.67 938.67 464 936
Dialogue: 2,0:03:42.99,0:03:48.00,Signs_EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\fnMasqualero\fs135\an8\blur0.8\bord0\b1\pos(960,156)\c&H5E5E61&}Episode {\c&H983EE1&}10
Dialogue: 2,0:03:42.99,0:03:48.00,Signs_EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\fnMasqualero\fs180\an8\blur0.8\bord0\b1\pos(960,360)\c&H4A4B4F&}My New {\c&H9030DD&}Rival in Love\N {\c&H4A4B4F&} Is a {\c&H9030DD&}P{\c&H4A4B4F&}e{\c&H9030DD&}r{\c&H4A4B4F&}f{\c&H9030DD&}e{\c&H4A4B4F&}c{\c&H9030DD&}t {\c&H4A4B4F&}S{\c&H9030DD&}u{\c&H4A4B4F&}p{\c&H9030DD&}e{\c&H4A4B4F&}r{\c&H9030DD&}h{\c&H4A4B4F&}u{\c&H9030DD&}m{\c&H4A4B4F&}a{\c&H9030DD&}n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.90,0:04:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only the battle for succession has been a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fearsome one and I was\Ndriven off as a casualty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.26,0:04:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a pretty story but I\Nam no longer true royalty so
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.42,0:04:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please I ask that you treat me\Nas an equal and nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been so
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.60,0:04:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,long far too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.28,0:04:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ask me I'm happy to see\Nyou looking well well enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.56,0:04:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness, you're even more\Nbeautiful than I remember. Oh, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a flatterer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.50,0:04:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.00,0:04:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, just one of the members of my staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.54,0:04:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, introduce yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.70,0:04:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greetings, I am Ray Taylor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.46,0:04:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tend to miss Claire's needs,\Nboth domestic and romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.44,0:05:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.40,0:05:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough, commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.62,0:05:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop playing games and tell\Nher what your job really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.26,0:05:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just tell people\NI'm your love slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.30,0:05:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of the scandal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.46,0:05:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is not what you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.80,0:05:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use the correct term\Nor get out of my sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.36,0:05:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I'm not your love\Nslave, then what am I to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.64,0:05:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Servant or maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take your pick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.12,0:05:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.14,0:05:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Ray, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.36,0:05:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.02,0:05:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.66,0:05:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're more than an ordinary\Nservant, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.34,0:05:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare they discard\Nsomeone of your caliber?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.78,0:05:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And favor such a dullard for the throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.82,0:05:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King Seuss must not\Nappreciate true excellence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, my mother isn't his legal wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, no, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything, I find solace in\Nbeing away from all the turmoil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Family discord is never fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.84,0:05:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know more about you, Ray?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.68,0:06:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A commoner admitted to the Royal Academy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be very talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.18,0:06:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.42,0:06:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She doesn't even come close to your level.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you think you were special?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.38,0:06:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That being a dual caster somehow\Nmade you superior to everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.20,0:06:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, my dear sister here\Nboasts four attributes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.90,0:06:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the world's only quadcaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.18,0:06:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that adorable smug face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.58,0:06:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She sounds like she's\Nbragging about her daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you even listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously you are not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.80,0:06:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talent for magic is\Nsomething you're born with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not as though I did\Nanything to earn this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.70,0:06:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why boast about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you say that your power is\Na sign that god has blessed you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.28,0:06:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always exaggerating. I am not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I felt that blessing for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meeting you was a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I wouldn't trade for\Nanything in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.46,0:06:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I lost my mother,\NI couldn't even cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.06,0:07:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was paralyzed with\Nguilt and self-loathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.50,0:07:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This part of her past isn't\Nsomething the game goes into.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a backdrop\Nto the initial setting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Duke Francois had business to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.94,0:07:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So after his wife's death,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he left young Miss Claire at the home\Nof a distant relative, Count Larnak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.72,0:07:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is where she met Princess Manaria.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.36,0:07:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pleasure to meet you, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.40,0:07:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does such a pretty girl look so sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.76,0:07:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.12,0:07:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said something awful to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.36,0:07:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't think I can\Never forgive myself for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:08:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, nobody blames you, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.40,0:08:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.16,0:08:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those words became my salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.76,0:08:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lifeline in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.96,0:08:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How time flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.72,0:08:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you believe it's been\Nten years since then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.02,0:08:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.32,0:08:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I still remember every\Nmoment like it was yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.68,0:08:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear to you here and now that\NI will always be your protector.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.86,0:08:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that moment, it was\Nlike you were glowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.98,0:09:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Una, you'll never believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.18,0:09:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I met the most wonderful,\Nhandsome, charming prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.88,0:09:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, I forgot about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You thought I was a boy\Nback when we first met.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.52,0:09:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you were as charming as any prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you can hardly blame me for\Nthinking that's what you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was shocked when I found\Nout the truth. Oh, were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.82,0:09:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear about that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, her name's Manaria.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.94,0:09:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and she's a princess\Nof the Zeus kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow! Are you right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.30,0:09:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.84,0:09:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.94,0:09:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.85,0:09:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.96,0:09:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be safe, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.76,0:09:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've kept you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.84,0:09:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Oh, don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.68,0:10:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't waiting that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.44,0:10:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the Amour Ceremony approaches,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,today's class will delve into\NPoesy, Amour, and other poems.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.82,0:10:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let the Verses of Love guide us through\Nthis enchanting literary journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.20,0:10:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray, have you got a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.64,0:10:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope I'm not catching you off guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I wanted to chat, and\Nmagic makes it so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.82,0:10:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.38,0:10:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't go poking around\Nin your private thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.14,0:10:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're using telepathic speech,\Nwhich is wind magic, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.40,0:10:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I should have known\Nyou'd be on top of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know how to connect?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.14,0:10:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You already did the hardest part for\Nme by establishing the magic channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.44,0:10:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was actually a breeze to tap into.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.08,0:11:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, what's going on? Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to know more about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.82,0:11:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Manaria appears in the\Ngame as an ally to the player.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire always wants to spend\Ntime with her when she's around,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.69,0:11:15.15,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\shad0\blur1\pos(0,0)\c&HFFFFFF&\fscx100\fscy100\p1}m 306.51 837.21 b 301.42 825.89 286.71 806.24 275.6 795.78 l 523.52 796.85 486.81 837.21
Dialogue: 2,0:11:08.69,0:11:15.15,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnBreezeSans\b0\bord0\fs35\fsp2\blur0.8\fad(269,1)\c&H000000&\3c&HFBF9FD&\pos(395,800)}Manaria
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which distracts Miss.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.44,0:11:12.15,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnBreezeSans\an7\fad(1,230)\b0\blur0.8\fs46\c&HFDFEFF&\pos(376.5,905)\clip(370,850,410,960)\t(21,230,\clip(370,850,710,960))}Care for some tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire and gives the player\Nmore time with the princes.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.19,0:11:15.15,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnBreezeSans\blur0.8\fs46\b0\c&HFFFFFA&\pos(376.5,905)\clip(370,850,435,960)\t(21,230,\clip(370,850,710,960))}Now's your chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.66,0:11:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Manaria comes in around\Nthe middle of the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.82,0:11:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and she can be super\Nhelpful for your strategy.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.15,0:11:25.78,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{=23}{\clip()\fscy100\t(28,5617,\fscy100.45)\fscx100\t(28,5617,\fscx100.45)\fnAdoraPROCn-55\an9\fs65\bord5\t(28,5617,\bord5.02)\blur1\fsp7\c&HFAFBFF&\3c&HFAFBFF&\frz51.05\move(1285,218,1334.28,276.66,28,5617)}Sousse Kingdom \NFirst Princess
