Dialogue: 2,0:11:20.15,0:11:25.78,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{=20}{\clip()\fscy100\t(28,5617,\fscy100.45)\fscx100\t(28,5617,\fscx100.45)\fnAveriaSerif-Regular\fs100\bord0\t(28,5617,\bord0)\blur0.8\fsp12\c&H111111&\frz51.05)\move(1555,510,1605.5,569.98,28,5617)}Mana{\blur0.9}r{\blur0.95}i{\blur1}a {\blur1.5}S{\blur1.6}o{\blur1.7}u{\blur1.8}s{\blur1.9}s{\blur2}e
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because she's so useful,\Nshe's a favor for most fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.36,0:11:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she's a total\Nfreaking buzzkill for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't care less about the princes,\Nand much prefer to rendezvous with Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.18,0:11:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.09,0:11:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So in my mind, Princess Manaria\Ntransforms from an ally to a rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.60,0:11:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that I'm not a fan of hers,\Nbut the fact that she steals Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire away sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.51,0:11:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that makes her my enemy.
