Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rae?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.12,0:11:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.66,0:11:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, can you still hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, irritatingly well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.64,0:11:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, of course I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.78,0:11:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost too clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.30,0:11:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, there's not much to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.22,0:11:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just your average commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.04,0:11:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure there's nothing about\Nme that would remotely interest you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.62,0:12:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.44,0:12:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a reaction I've\Nnever experienced before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.54,0:12:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm even more intrigued.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.52,0:12:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your reading of that poem today\Nwas amazing, Princess Manaria.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Question though,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.55,0:12:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why the shift from the\Nusual I dedicate this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.84,0:12:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,poem to you to I deliver this poem to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.26,0:12:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's cool either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.42,0:12:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.54,0:12:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.45,0:12:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An old form of prosody I\Nborrowed from an ancient poem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.56,0:12:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're well, Red Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.94,0:12:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you care to join\Nthe discussion? Oh, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not exactly a big poetry gal,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.46,0:12:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'm afraid I'm going to\Nhave to pass on that offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I hope that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.50,0:12:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.54,0:12:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you say no to an\Ninvite from Princess Manaria?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.38,0:12:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having talent doesn't mean\Nyou can afford to get cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.10,0:12:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.01,0:12:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is Rey truly that brilliant?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.00,0:12:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can take on anyone in a magic battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.42,0:12:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Prince Rod. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.52,0:12:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that sounds intriguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.20,0:12:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to have a bout with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:12:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.86,0:13:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you can't face her like\Nyou would a normal opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.66,0:13:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I played chess against her one\Ntime, and she left my head spinning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.38,0:13:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She eluded even you, Prince Rod?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.24,0:13:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.54,0:13:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.92,0:13:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hey, if you're looking for a bout,\NI'd be happy to oblige, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.24,0:13:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.15,0:13:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping I'd get\Nthe chance to see your
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.66,0:13:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,minions in action while\NI was here in Bower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.90,0:13:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.81,0:13:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you know what you're getting into.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.80,0:13:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a good time to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ready for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.56,0:13:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope you don't mind if I go all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.56,0:13:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.90,0:13:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you've got a lot of people\Ntalking about your skills as a quadcaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see what all the fuck's about!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.20,0:13:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, would you look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.62,0:14:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was excellently done!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.22,0:14:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's fast, and her precision\Nis exceptional, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.02,0:14:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't even flinch?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about this thing? Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.86,0:14:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.02,0:14:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have some firepower, Prince Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.10,0:14:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rumors sell you short. I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earth magic this time, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.80,0:14:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see, what should I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.36,0:14:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems rather uncouth to fight\Nfire with fire, so maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.24,0:14:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something a little more like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.48,0:14:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice minions?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.44,0:15:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, pretty bold of you to\Nuse my own move against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.66,0:15:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you prepared to surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.20,0:15:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.72,0:15:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't think you want me to either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.76,0:15:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.66,0:15:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be curious to see just\Nhow long you can hold out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.46,0:15:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he draws this out, she'll\Nbe at a major disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.16,0:15:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be true for anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.62,0:15:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch closely and you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.90,0:15:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Manaria has an\Nace or two up her sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.70,0:15:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, got it. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.98,0:15:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think she can still win?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.84,0:15:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they've both got\Nplenty of fight left in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.70,0:15:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only time will tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.80,0:15:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she can't keep this up for long!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.18,0:16:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rod is using his immense amount\Nof magical power to wear her down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.46,0:16:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to overwhelm\Nher just like he did Misha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.18,0:16:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine. I surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.82,0:16:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a brilliant showing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.44,0:16:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Professor Torrid. Class.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.48,0:16:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last spell that was used?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.42,0:16:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who can name it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.34,0:16:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called Spellbreaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.52,0:16:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.66,0:16:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It analyzes a spell's composition, forces\Nitself into it, and undoes it completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.24,0:16:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's magic that erases magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.12,0:17:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can evaluate and tear apart\Na spell in the middle of combat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.70,0:17:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea that was possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.96,0:17:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For most people, it wouldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.98,0:17:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it comes to water, earth,\Nand fire, her aptitude is high.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.80,0:17:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in wind, she's even\Nstronger, ranking exceptional.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.54,0:17:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.76,0:17:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's more to it than that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.10,0:17:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something that makes her\Nmagic truly frightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive my crude methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a very difficult girl\Nto figure out, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.20,0:17:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get that a lot, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.14,0:17:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sister was incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.62,0:17:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Spellbreaker was fantastic, but do\Nyou know what I found more impressive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.80,0:17:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.71,0:17:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way she faced Prince Rod so\Nboldly with no hesitation. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.80,0:17:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like watching a battle between\Nthe mythical gods of beauty and war.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, if you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.32,0:17:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.23,0:17:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's quite the tepid response.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.72,0:18:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you in a foul mood\Nfor some reason? Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, just Peachy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.56,0:18:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.12,0:18:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be you're jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.60,0:18:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes! That was fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't much sense in denying it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.60,0:18:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,considering how clear I've\Nmade my feelings for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.94,0:18:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just because you've made them clear\Ndoesn't mean that I accept them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.94,0:18:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I do to make you\Nrealize that I'm serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.84,0:18:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing, so let's leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.84,0:18:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though, I suppose...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.30,0:18:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you would show your devotion, place\Nan offering upon the scales for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.34,0:18:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Above all, the flowers of flora\Nwill prove your love's veracity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.64,0:18:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's from Poesie Amour. Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poesie Amour is a poetic retelling\Nof an old Bauer Kingdom legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.94,0:18:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The story goes that there were two suitors\Nwho fell in love with the same priestess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.30,0:18:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both were powerful men, so the conflict\Nbetween them echoed through the nation,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.14,0:18:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plunging it into chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.12,0:18:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Troubled to be the source of such strife,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:18:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the priestess prayed and God presented her
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.46,0:19:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with a set of scales\Nalong with these words.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.34,0:19:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let those who would wed you place\Ntheir offerings upon these scales.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.40,0:19:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They will tip in favor of the\Nman who is to be your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In accordance with the scale's judgment,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.32,0:19:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the priestess married the man\Nwho offered flowers of flora.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.12,0:19:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for the man who lost in love, he\Nwent on to become an excellent king.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.44,0:19:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From that ancient legend\Ncame the Amur ceremony,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.80,0:19:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which is still performed to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean, the scales of love mentioned\Nin Poesia Amur really do exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.68,0:19:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're most likely a magic tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.42,0:19:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Items with magic stones in\Nthem have been around for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.74,0:19:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People have used them since long\Nbefore we knew how they worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.32,0:19:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suitors' offerings are still placed upon
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.28,0:19:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the scales of love\Nduring the Amor ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even now, people use it to choose\Nwho they're going to marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.18,0:19:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sort of like a cross between an\Narranged marriage and a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.40,0:19:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or a high-stakes\Nreenactment of Poesie Amour.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Famed artifact or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.92,0:20:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,very few people are truly willing to entrust\Ntheir futures to such a farcical game.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.64,0:20:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there are those\Nwho use the ceremony as
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an excuse to confess\Ntheir love every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.54,0:20:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People are always waiting to see\Nwho will confess and to whom what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.28,0:20:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fascinating tradition and so romantic!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.12,0:20:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see now why everyone\Nis so giddy about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.68,0:20:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.52,0:20:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who among us will be putting their\Nlove to the test on the scales?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.36,0:20:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can sit this one out, Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.08,0:20:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've already got Rae Prince, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.58,0:20:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another mystery solved, so that's\Nhow it is between the two of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.24,0:20:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the last thing I need\Nis someone else spouting this
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.98,0:20:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nonsense and that's what it\Nis—the girl is only teasing me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.25,0:20:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still really believe I'm not being\Nsincere about my feelings for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.74,0:20:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's unrequited love on Ray's part?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.08,0:20:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm—love given but not\Nreturned or acknowledged.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.88,0:20:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.06,0:20:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I were to court a\Npartner of the same gender,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.26,0:20:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would obviously choose sister over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.56,0:21:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be hard to hear, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.28,0:21:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As much as you may adore her,\NClaire says that she prefers me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.06,0:21:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness—this is
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.44,0:21:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a rather sudden display of affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.46,0:21:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, if I said that I loved\Nyou, would you believe me, Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.52,0:21:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In all these years, I've never\Ndoubted the sincerity of your love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.54,0:21:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let your head explode, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.48,0:21:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cute numbers or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.92,0:21:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sister, stop—I'm blushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.74,0:21:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,2, 3, 5, 7,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.22,0:21:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,11, 13, 17, 19, 23, 29, 31, 37, 31?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.04,0:21:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two get along well?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.10,0:21:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must be quite close?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.68,0:21:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,must be quite close More tea, anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this chatting must be thirsty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.76,0:21:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but that isn't the teapot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.00,0:21:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the milk pitcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.36,0:21:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, terribly sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.94,0:21:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look rather pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.82,0:21:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you fallen ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.28,0:21:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I'm perfectly fine I\Nappreciate the concern, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.28,0:22:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about when's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.80,0:22:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one you're\Nsupposed to be in love with,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.66,0:22:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not that quad-testing royal interloper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.38,0:22:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I have said when?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.80,0:22:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow ...
