Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.88,0:23:22.05,ed_eng_10_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Are you shameless? Stop this at once!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.05,0:23:25.51,ed_eng_10_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Once again, I keep overreacting... you're annoying!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.93,0:23:31.76,ed_eng_10_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}She is my wonder girl of world!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.76,0:23:35.77,ed_eng_10_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Someone who I had no chance to see in my world,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.76,0:23:35.77,ed_eng_10_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)\3c&HF97107&}Someone who I could never meet back in my world,
